This package defines the abstract :class:`WorkerCleanupQueue` contract and the
:func:`get_worker_cleanup_queue` factory. Concrete implementations live in
sibling modules (for example
``prefect.server.worker_communication.cleanup_queue.memory``) and are selected
via the ``PREFECT_SERVER_WORKER_CHANNEL_CLEANUP_QUEUE_STORAGE`` setting.
